WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.350
{preview}

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:34.070
The following tale is a work of pure fiction.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:40.950
The Hiragumo pales to the immenseness of the vessel, aye?

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:49.700
Truthfully, Milord...

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:55.550
size and virtue are of different schools.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:03.930
The Hiragumo teakettle and Great Atakebune are of equal grandeur.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:11.190
<b>Fantasy of the Tea Room {ts}</b>

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:16.340
Masters Tsuda Sougyuu, Imai Soukyuu, and Senno Soueki.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.950
What have ye tea masters to say of the vessel?

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:29.580
All sea-worthy vessels, including those of barbarians, pale in comparison to the Great Atakebune.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:35.170
The areas covered by iron plates may effectively repel arrows and fire alike.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:38.060
The vessel is already perfect, in essence.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.050
What say ye, Soueki?

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.430
The vessel lacks a crucial ingredient for perfection.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:59.820
I find painting the vessel black to be most suitable.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.350
"Black" beckons forth Death.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:11.460
Mori's navy would see Death itself, sailing towards them.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.270
Very intriguing.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:17.990
Every vessel in the fleet is to be painted black!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:23.680
Soueki, you shall prepare the day's tea.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.320
Impeccable insight.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:32.350
Milord's wisdom truly allows for brilliant ideas.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:37.110
Master Senno possesses great bravery, to deem the vessel lacking.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:43.110
His suggestion to paint the vessel black was also unforeseen...

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.970
May I have your name? {onna wa}

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:51.820
I am a vassal of Lord Oda Nobunaga, Furuta Sasuke.

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:06.230
Imposing, is the famed master of tea, Senno Soueki.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>Yamashiro Province {ts}</b>

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>Kamikuze Manor {ts}</b>

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.880
As usual, your tea is superb.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.080
'Twas by the good word of Oda Nobunaga

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:49.130
that I realize the worthy addition to the Nakagawa clan.

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:52.450
You've married a worthy man, Osen.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.390
Please, Brother.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:58.630
Though I was born to a modest clan, unlike Brother Kiyohide and Osen,

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:03.350
shamefully, my only worth is brewing a modest bowl of tea.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:04.900
Naught is wrong of modesty.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:08.210
Modesty builds on the character of a warrior.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:14.680
By nature, I am uncultured in tea, and would do best with a modest bowl. {until kaete komaru}

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:20.210
However, Milord, Araki Murashige, holds tea ceremonies far too often.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.740
Milord possesses many famous tea treasures, and boasts to such a degree

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:27.350
that I struggle to conceal my uncultured nature when prompted to comment.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.850
He possesses such treasures?

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:35.310
Our war against the Ikko-ikki has intensified as of recent.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.560
Therein, my visits shall become less frequent.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.240
My gratitude for the tea!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.200
Brother Kiyohide is bound by war.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:56.680
He is simple-minded by nature, and performs the duties desired of him. {until suji wo toranaikoto ya}

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.870
I've naught but envy for simplicity.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.660
I care naught for it. {iyanano desuyo}

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.420
I would become a seasoned warrior through war alone.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.390
And yet... {dakara}

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:07.170
I would live, craving naught but battle.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.470
regardless the cruelty of your orders...

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.120
And, my feats would garner swift promotions a-plenty.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:16.710
for the sake of achievements, you would be married to war. {until hatasou to suru no desu}

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:20.090
'Tis most unfortunate that I, instead, survey the scenery in midst of battles.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:26.100
'Tis also dangerous to survey the scenery in the midst of battle.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.380
Which reminds me...

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:33.870
the Shino tea bowl from the Great Kiln of Mino has arrived.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.130
It has?! {nani kita ka}

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:52.410
This spectacular white glaze is seen only in the wares of the Ming Mainland.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.920
Though lacking the lucid white of Ming wares, {until shiro de wa nai ga}

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:58.440
'tis a marvelous bowl made from mogusa clay and glazed with feldspar.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.310
Have you sent a tribute to the Great Kiln?

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.890
I must express my gratitude for their superb craft.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.190
Unfortunately...

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:14.060
we lack such leeway at present.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:16.860
Forgive me, Osen.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:22.240
Though I succeed my late father in governing this manor,

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.730
I receive but a modest stipend for my services. {morau roku wa shiretamono}

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:28.460
Were I more resourceful, we would not suffer poverty.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.470
On the contrary, we are quite fortunate.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.630
Our child thrives in this era of war,

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:39.980
and I neither starve or grieve.

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:46.480
I am fortunate to have you, my love, bring joy into my life with your character.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.900
Her warm, and yet flushed delicate skin

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:04.970
retains a pale white suppleness about it.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.030
This color is akin to...

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:14.220
Perhaps its color and virtue originated from this complexion.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:20.780
Nay, the Shino bowl exemplifies a feeling of subtleness. {until han to iu kanji}

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:25.350
Given the two, I would describe this feeling as suppleness.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.710
Suppleness...

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:30.050
Only with a nipple, is a breast whole and supple.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:34.330
This Shino bowl would be whole and equal to the wares of the old Goryeo Kingdom

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.740
were the redness of the rim more profound. {koi akaiiro ka ga nani ka iru}

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.520
I request the presence of Governor Furuta!

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.080
I am a messenger of Lord Oda Nobunaga!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:53.950
The Lord of the Settsu Province, Araki Murashige, has rebelled against Milord!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.140
He confines himself to Arioka Castle.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:00.260
General Araki was found guilty of contacting Mori and Ikko-ikki forces, {until wo tsuji}

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.720
and expressing his will to rebel!

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:05.910
Hours ago, my brother and vassal to Murashige, Nakagawa Kiyohide, {until nakagawadono ga}

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:09.400
left my residence to subjugate the Ikko-ikki!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:13.680
'Tis likely that General Araki shall call his vassals to his aid.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:16.040
Milord beckons to his vassals.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.280
You are to rendezvous with Milord's main force.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:24.000
<b>October 1578 {ts}</b>

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:24.000
<b>Omi Province Azuchi {ts}</b>

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:35.130
Nakagawa Kiyohide confines himself to Ibaraki Castle.

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:39.300
He serves the rebels, rather I.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.890
You are married to his sister, aye?

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:47.890
Aye.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:52.120
Ask your brother to return to me, and I shall spare him.

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:56.670
I wish not to kill both competent generals.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.660
However, refusal to yield results in death.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.010
Aye.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:12.250
<b>November 1578 {ts}</b>

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:12.250
<b>Settsu Province Arioka Castle {ts}</b>

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:15.050
I shall be granted amnesty in exchange for my mother as their hostage?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:18.450
Nobunaga plans destroy our clan, regardless of an exchange.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.580
He is the Sixth Demon Lord! {aitsu wa sou iu otoko ya}

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:27.740
Tell Nobunaga that I shan't die a pitiful death alike Matsunaga Hisahide!

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:28.420
Aye!

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.380
Our rear is guarded by Mori's forces, {until mouri zei}

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:36.090
and to fore are my skilled generals, 
Nakagawa Kiyohide and Takayama Ukon!

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:41.120
I was the one who suppressed the rebellious provinces of the West!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:45.120
I shan't yield my treasures to that upstart from Owari!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:51.880
<b>Settsu Province Ibaraki Castle {ts}</b>

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:54.130
My heart shan't be swayed, no matter how many messengers he sends!

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:57.010
I shan't submit to Nobunaga!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:01.640
I obey the orders of Milord, and shall hold the fore 'til death!

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:07.370
The messenger he sends is none other than your brother... {until otouto}

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.140
Furuta Sasuke.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.140
My brother?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.990
He covers his body in white armor...

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.160
Why? {naniue}

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:38.190
General Takayama has surrendered Takatsuki Castle,

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:41.040
and the tide of war has shifted in Milord's favor.

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:44.050
Brother, I require a decision.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:51.390
Drowned have ye, in your tea brewery, and neglect the duties of a warrior?

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:57.330
A true warrior remains steadfast to his lord, even having lost favor.

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:01.900
Though ye demand my life be spared, I shan't acquiesce.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:06.910
Perhaps I have drowned in my obsessions of aesthetics and tea. {until sugiteorimashita}

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.700
But ponder this, Brother!

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:15.720
I shall end my aesthete heart this day, and become a true warrior.

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:26.390
Why is Osen here?!

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:34.390
Though it is just for a warrior to remain loyal to his lord, {until suji nara}

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:38.570
'tis just to have their siblings share his fate.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:46.950
As ye retain loyalty to Araki, I must display loyalty to Milord. {until akashi to shite}

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:54.160
I hereby execute the sister of the rebel, Nakagawa Kiyohide!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.500
'Tis my duty as a true warrior!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.430
Are you mad?! {chimayotta ka sasuke}

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.640
Kill Osen, and we shall put you to death!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:14.960
Very well! {gyoi}

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:17.150
In death, I wear white!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.690
Very well!

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:53.970
I surrender...

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.010
You have my gratitude, Osen.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:05.940
Death reigns over this era of war.

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:11.290
Though I may perish, 'tis by the welcome hand of my beloved.

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.720
I am an aesthete no longer.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:22.790
Today, I am reborn as a warrior who desires naught but achievements.

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:28.540
I aim to ascend the fame of the Furuta clan to that of Milord's!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.320
Milord!

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:37.810
Nakagawa Kiyohide has acquiesced to amnesty, and surrendered Ibaraki Castle.

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:39.840
To whom did he acquiesce?

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:41.570
Furuta Sasuke, Milord.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:46.420
Reward him for his efforts.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:50.540
Tell Sasuke to cooperate with Nakagawa, whilst under observation.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:51.320
Aye!

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:53.530
Press forth!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.830
We lay siege to Araki Murashige's final stronghold, Arioka Castle!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>1579 {ts}</b>

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>Settsu Province Arioka Castle {ts}</b>

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:08.580
A year-long siege yields a harvest, without its farmer.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.140
Araki abandoned his vassals and family to escape.

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.300
I prefer Milord's cruelty to Araki's cowardice. {uchi no oyakata no hou ga mashi da}

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:16.120
We've discovered Araki's whereabouts!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:18.100
Capture the rebel!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.850
<b>1579 {ts}</b>

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.850
<b>Settsu Province Hanakuma Castle {ts}</b>

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.970
Araki has not yet escaped!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:28.800
Take his head, and ye shall be met with great rewards!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:38.040
I have the edge, given my accumulated knowledge of castles I've ventured!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.010
Await my return, Osen!

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:46.610
I return with the achievement...

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.920
of taking Araki's head!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.430
Milord, ye must escape immediately.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.540
They shall take your head upon discovery.

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:06.940
Nobunaga's forces have taken Amagasaki, and executed your remaining brethren and vassals!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:13.450
Milord, escape with thy life, and allow others to kill Nobunaga in your stead.

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:24.300
Halt!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.880
I know your visage.

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:36.010
Why, General Araki, do ye who once obtained Milord's fancy, make an unsightly escape? {until nanigoto zo}

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:39.720
A dog of the Sixth Demon Lord shan't understand me!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:44.270
Why not face death honorably, as Matsunaga Hisahide had?

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:56.760
Though ye were alike, he displayed a grand end!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:59.450
Ponder ye not the example of a true warrior?!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:07.960
'T-Tis the triple cedar insignia of
Magoroku Kanemoto-crafted swords! {all the way until kanemoto de wa nai ka}

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.710
How do ye come to possess such a...!

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:17.680
Concern yourself not with my blade!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.950
'Tis the legendary tea bowl, Araki Kourai!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:47.960
Fabled in the scrolls of the Higashiyama period, 'tis the legendary glazed tea bowl!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:10.480
These wonderfully coarse protrusions compliment the lovely loquatesque glaze...

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:14.970
What brilliant mind conceived this beautiful pattern?

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:20.040
I've no knowledge of your identity, {until mekiki}

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:23.730
but the blade and appraisal imply ye an aesthete.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:29.020
A castle may be raised with that bowl.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.500
Spare me, and ye may have it.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:43.260
From birth, we are possessed by greed which we struggle to command.

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:50.270
Were one's clan executed, one's greed compels him to struggle to survive. {until shitataka ni naru}

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:57.960
Governor Matsunaga chose to end his life as a proper warrior.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:18:59.540
However...

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:02.540
my karma is greater than his!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.460
<b>April 1580 {ts}</b>

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.460
<b>Kyoto Daitoku Temple {ts}</b>

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.630
Master Senno invites me, a mere acquaintance, to tea...

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:36.370
Though my courage was above the merchant's, Master Senno defeated my own.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:03.590
Master Senno Soueki, ye have my gratitude for inviting me.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:07.460
Though I learned of brewing tea in infancy, {until teido}

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.850
hesitate not to strike at my ignorance.

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.600
Your presence honors me.

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.070
Master, I've an inquiry. {until yoroshii ka}

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:22.400
Are my sandals appropriate for this setting? {until kore de yoroshii no ka}

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.610
These are my only...

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.770
Fear not, for I prepare ye sandals of leather soles.

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:30.500
Your sandals shall disturb the peace.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.580
Indeed, the soles of my sandals shall disturb the surroundings.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.390
Though, is this necessary?

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:47.800
Are the conducts of brewing tea not to draw out the beauty of its simplicity?

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:02.060
The stone path leads into this entry...

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:04.900
Is this the entry to the tea room?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.410
How may one enter whilst adorning his sword?!

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.490
Am I to place it there?

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:15.350
My sword, on such crude slats of wood?!

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.900
Does Master Senno mock the hearts of warriors?!

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:21.910
Or, does he feel swords unnecessary in brewing tea?

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:25.630
With regret, I shall observe his practice.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:32.980
Should his reasoning be naught but foolishness, I shall have his head.

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:54.740
This mere tea room led me into the Heavens?!

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:58.110
'Tis the effect of room's simplicity at play.

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:03.050
The room faded into a space, forcing my eyes to view the surroundings as the Heavens.

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:04.910
I feel awakened...

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:09.050
Every article of beauty I've seen feels distant from this room.

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:11.600
I've never felt such complexity!

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:20.410
I could say naught to the Master...

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:25.150
Your tea.

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:34.580
Spare me, and ye may have it.

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:44.340
Did Master Senno learn of my actions...?!

00:24:35.780 --> 00:24:37.450
<b>I am but another vessel of greed {ts}</b>

00:24:41.040 --> 00:24:42.750
<b>Epicness{ts}</b>

00:24:47.460 --> 00:24:49.130
<b>'Tis incorrect!{ts}</b>

00:24:50.140 --> 00:24:52.190
Next time, "Stairway to the Heavens."

00:24:53.160 --> 00:24:57.930
Does the fork joining the warrior and aesthete truly exist?

00:24:56.590 --> 00:24:59.920
<b>Stairway to the Heavens {ts}</b>
